    <string name="onboarding_what_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="onboarding_what_body">Add your medications and dose times. DoseTrack reminds you at the right time and lets you mark each dose as taken or skipped, so you can see your history. It works fully offline and needs no account.\n\nDoseTrack is a reminder tool only. It does not give medical advice or recommend changing your doses.</string>
